From: Anonymous <anonymous@example.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Feb 2026 23:09:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 22/56] Strip `asInstanceOf` casts in `ENode.fromTree`

The types in asInstanceOf casts (especially qualified types containing
ENodeParamRef) are not properly hash-consed, causing structurally equal
ENodes to fail the `eq` check in EGraph.merge. Since casts don't affect
runtime values, we skip them in fromTree.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
