Subject: [PATCH 23/56] Decompose `Atom(TermRef)` into `Select` during
 canonicalization

Atom(TermRef(prefix, member)) and Select(Atom(prefix), member) are two
representations of the same path that were never unified in the EGraph.
Assumptions produced Atom(TermRef) while tree decomposition produced
Select nodes, causing truth propagation to miss the Select form.

Fix by decomposing Atom(TermRef) into normalizeSelect(Atom(prefix), member)
during canonicalization so both representations converge.

