From: Anonymous <anonymous@example.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Mar 2026 11:08:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 40/56] Prefer constructor-based Apply nodes in e-graph merge
 order

When merging two Apply nodes in the e-graph, prefer the one wrapping
a Constructor as the representant. This allows normalizeSelect to
reduce field accesses (e.g., new RRange(0, 10).from -> 0) during
repair, enabling the solver to prove goals like i < a.size.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
