From 1b1e5a740da7e5c5938c5a9728e03fe9ca668c71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anonymous <anonymous@example.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Mar 2026 17:27:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 43/56] Fix confusion between bound and free variables in
 qualifier solver

Use negative indices for free variables in impliesCommonParams to
distinguish them from bound variables inside nested lambdas. Fix
SubstEParamsMap to properly shift de Bruijn indices when traversing
QualifiedAnnotation lambdas embedded in types.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
