Subject: [PATCH 48/56] Add Equal/Not normalization and propagation in EGraph
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Constant-fold Equal(const1, const2) using constFoldBinaryOp, normalize
Not(true/false) and Not(Not(x)), and propagate Not(x) ≡ true/false
during repair. This enables IfThenElse reduction when branch conditions
rule out specific cases (e.g. fib_memoized).

